**/obj/
**/out/
**/Debug/
**/Release/
**/x64/
**/x86/
**/AnyCPU/
**/artifacts/
**/publish/
**/TestResults/

# Packages générés
*.nupkg
*.snupkg

# Fichiers de compilation générés
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.cache
*.tmp_proj
